<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <LangVersion>7.3</LangVersion>
    <ImplicitUsings>disable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>disable</Nullable>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <PackAsTool>true</PackAsTool>
    <ToolCommandName>vk-nf-iec61850-scl</ToolCommandName>
    <Version>0.1.0-preview.1</Version>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageIcon>nugetIcon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <Description>지원 범위 안의 IEC 61850 SCL 파일을 nanoFramework용 정적 C# Server 모델로 변환하는 .NET 10 PC 도구입니다. 평가용 사전 릴리스입니다.</Description>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    <None Include="..\..\..\Build\nugetIcon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <Import Project="..\..\..\Build\PackageReadme.targets" />
  <Target Name="IncludePackageReadme" BeforeTargets="_GetPackageFiles" DependsOnTargets="PreparePackageReadme">
    <ItemGroup>
      <None Include="$(GeneratedPackageReadme)" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    </ItemGroup>
  </Target>
</Project>
